  "idea": "AI meeting recording summarizer that pushes key decisions to Notion",
  "text": "This AI tool transcribes your calls, extracts key decisions, and syncs everything directly into Notion. Remote teams waste hours rewatching meeting recordings just to locate one specific client agreement or deadline. Without centralized documentation, agreed deliverables disappear into video archives and never translate into actual work. Use Fireflies with a Make webhook to push timestamped decisions and assigned tasks into your Notion database. This eliminates administrative busywork across your company.",
